WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.440
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.520 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:59.080 --> 02:03.480
HAOTIAN TOWER, SHUIYUNTIAN

02:03.560 --> 02:05.480
You are a criminal who was sealed.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.640
You want to trick me into letting you out.

02:14.400 --> 02:16.400
You'd better not mention me

02:16.480 --> 02:18.720
in the same breath as those losers.

02:19.320 --> 02:20.600
My patience is limited.

02:21.400 --> 02:23.520
Destroy the Haotian Matrix now.

02:24.040 --> 02:25.160
Otherwise,

02:25.800 --> 02:27.520
I'll kill you now.

02:39.640 --> 02:42.120
You're just an immortal criminal.

02:43.080 --> 02:44.600
You're not a big deal.

02:44.680 --> 02:47.000
You keep talking about yourself.

02:47.080 --> 02:48.600
You're just more powerful than me.

02:49.400 --> 02:52.120
Anyone in Shuiyuntian
is more powerful than me.

02:52.680 --> 02:55.280
Besides, we've switched bodies.

02:55.360 --> 02:57.800
If you kill me now, you kill yourself.

02:57.880 --> 02:59.320
We can just die together.

03:00.160 --> 03:01.040
Come on.

03:01.120 --> 03:02.920
You reminded me.

03:27.440 --> 03:28.760
My hair!

03:28.840 --> 03:30.080
Don't forget.

03:30.640 --> 03:32.520
You're also in my hands now.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.680
I won't let you off the hook!

04:11.880 --> 04:13.920
I'll make you bald today!

04:15.160 --> 04:16.399
Stop.

04:18.000 --> 04:19.519
How dare you be so presumptuous?

04:20.240 --> 04:23.120
Do you believe
that I'll break your arms off now?

04:23.200 --> 04:24.840
Then I'll cut your neck off.

04:25.400 --> 04:26.880
You dare talk nonsense.

04:27.360 --> 04:29.480
You don't seem
to want your tongue anymore.

04:29.560 --> 04:31.120
If you dare touch my tongue, I'll…

04:31.600 --> 04:33.480
I'll use my power
to destroy your immortal root.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.520
Do you dare?

04:34.600 --> 04:35.680
Why not?

04:35.760 --> 04:37.200
My immortal root is damaged anyway.

04:37.280 --> 04:38.600
I'll just destroy yours.

04:38.680 --> 04:39.600
I'm not afraid.

04:45.800 --> 04:47.440
My hair.

04:50.480 --> 04:52.680
My 1,000 years of hair

04:54.040 --> 04:56.040
is all gone.

04:57.160 --> 04:58.320
Don't cry.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.480
It's all gone.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.920
I can't braid my hair anymore.

05:04.560 --> 05:06.280
I can't wear a hairpin either.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.280
I even have to stay

05:10.000 --> 05:12.280
in this immortal criminal body of yours.

05:12.360 --> 05:14.160
I told you not to cry.

05:16.280 --> 05:18.320
I can't pass the immortal examination too.

05:19.040 --> 05:21.600
I can never go back to Arbiter Hall.

05:24.120 --> 05:26.720
I'm only 1,500 years old.

05:26.800 --> 05:28.280
I'm still so young.

05:28.360 --> 05:31.360
Why is my life so miserable?

05:32.080 --> 05:32.960
Get up.

05:33.040 --> 05:35.360
Give me back my hair!

05:35.440 --> 05:36.600
Get up.

05:36.680 --> 05:39.240
Give me back my hair!

05:55.400 --> 05:56.400
Enough.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.520
Get up.

06:06.320 --> 06:07.640
Clean your face.

06:14.200 --> 06:16.240
You're the first person in history

06:16.880 --> 06:18.640
to threaten me.

06:18.720 --> 06:22.000
You're also the first person in history
to make me cry like a man.

06:22.080 --> 06:24.880
I don't want to stay
in your lousy body any longer.

06:26.120 --> 06:28.040
It's just some Haotian Matrix.

06:28.120 --> 06:30.040
Today, I'll break it for you.

06:30.120 --> 06:31.920
Let's figure out a way as soon as possible

06:32.000 --> 06:33.200
when we get out.

06:33.800 --> 06:36.680
People from the Heavenly Realm
always claim to be honorable.

06:38.120 --> 06:39.360
But when things happen,

06:40.040 --> 06:41.800
you only care about yourself.

06:42.680 --> 06:45.040
You still help me break this seal.

06:45.800 --> 06:47.920
I'm just an orchid plant.

06:48.000 --> 06:50.040
If you want a plant
to think about these things,

06:50.120 --> 06:53.400
then why do we need the heavenly soldiers,
heavenly emperors, and fairy lords?

06:53.880 --> 06:55.080
Besides,

06:55.160 --> 06:56.080
my master said that

06:56.160 --> 06:58.000
stealing one's job
is like killing one's mother.

06:58.080 --> 06:59.400
I can't do these things.

07:03.520 --> 07:04.800
Little Flower Spirit,

07:05.560 --> 07:08.040
you have some traits of the Moon Tribe.

07:08.960 --> 07:10.600
Enough. Don't disturb me.

07:47.520 --> 07:50.040
I don't know how to use your body.

07:51.400 --> 07:54.640
How could there be
such a stupid person in this world?

07:54.720 --> 07:56.560
Do you have any ideas?

07:56.640 --> 07:58.320
You only know how to order people around.

07:58.920 --> 07:59.840
Forget it.

08:00.400 --> 08:02.360
I really can't count on a loser like you.

08:06.720 --> 08:09.480
Everything has its cause.

08:10.960 --> 08:14.160
We must have done something
that caused us to switch bodies.

08:15.200 --> 08:16.080
Now,

08:16.920 --> 08:19.680
if we repeat
what we were doing before we switched,

08:20.640 --> 08:22.320
maybe we can switch back.

08:39.280 --> 08:43.039
FOUNTAIN PALACE, SHUIYUNTIAN

08:43.120 --> 08:44.240
My lord, you're back.

08:48.040 --> 08:48.960
Lord Ronghao is here.

08:49.600 --> 08:50.720
He is waiting inside.

08:50.800 --> 08:51.960
Bring me the Green Flame Wine

08:52.040 --> 08:53.560
that I've brought back
from the Northernmost Ocean.

08:53.640 --> 08:55.160
He doesn't like other things.

08:55.680 --> 08:56.680
He only loves good wine.

08:56.760 --> 08:57.640
Go.

08:58.880 --> 08:59.720
Yes.

09:28.160 --> 09:32.960
FAIRYLAND IN PAINTING

09:50.280 --> 09:53.280
There's a triumphant return celebration
at Yunzhong Water Pavilion.

09:53.360 --> 09:54.280
It's very lively.

09:54.800 --> 09:55.720
But you refuse to go.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.320
How arrogant.

09:59.720 --> 10:01.320
I'm just a mere immortal.

10:01.400 --> 10:02.520
I don't have to go.

10:03.280 --> 10:05.760
You, the main character
of this celebration, are not attending.

10:06.560 --> 10:08.600
Aren't you afraid
that Lord Yunzhong will blame you?

10:09.080 --> 10:12.320
RONGHAO, FAIRY LORD

10:30.400 --> 10:31.840
When the seal was reinforced today,

10:32.480 --> 10:34.560
an innocent fairy fell into Haotian Tower.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.360
I failed to save her.

10:37.400 --> 10:38.640
I lost a life.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.680
But my brother and the rest

10:41.240 --> 10:42.600
didn't have any response at all.

10:43.360 --> 10:44.360
As expected.

10:44.920 --> 10:46.360
Those hypocrites of Shuiyuntian.

10:47.120 --> 10:48.800
I never want to drink or talk with them.

10:49.840 --> 10:50.680
You should know that.

10:52.320 --> 10:53.480
Me too.

10:53.560 --> 10:56.600
I'd rather be with this lonely lake
and remote mountain.

10:56.680 --> 10:57.520
I'd rather

10:58.600 --> 10:59.680
have a drink with you.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.880
Green Flame Wine
from the Northernmost Ocean?

11:15.280 --> 11:16.520
It lives up to its reputation.

11:26.000 --> 11:26.840
Good wine.

11:39.880 --> 11:41.560
Xishan is a really good place.

11:43.360 --> 11:45.280
I think that goddess, Xiyun,

11:45.360 --> 11:46.720
must be stunning.

11:49.240 --> 11:50.280
What are you holding?

11:51.400 --> 11:52.480
Something from your lover?

11:53.120 --> 11:54.000
It's nothing.

11:54.600 --> 11:55.600
It's just a handkerchief.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.320
Ronghao.

12:16.400 --> 12:17.480
It seems like

12:18.080 --> 12:19.160
there's something on it.

12:21.680 --> 12:23.360
You can fool others, but not me.

12:27.400 --> 12:29.280
I wonder why

12:29.360 --> 12:31.680
you keep staring at a handkerchief.

12:32.960 --> 12:35.560
There are no poetries or patterns on it.

12:35.640 --> 12:36.880
What are you looking at?

12:37.800 --> 12:38.760
I didn't expect you

12:39.360 --> 12:41.120
to hide the pattern.

12:44.200 --> 12:45.480
Actually,

12:46.520 --> 12:48.760
you and the goddess
only have a marriage engagement.

12:49.280 --> 12:50.400
You've never met each other.

12:51.000 --> 12:51.880
Besides,

12:52.400 --> 12:53.760
she has been gone for 30,000 years.

12:54.360 --> 12:55.520
What if she doesn't come back?

12:55.600 --> 12:57.080
It's my marriage engagement with her.

12:57.960 --> 12:59.960
Even if she has been away
for more than 30,000 years,

13:00.040 --> 13:01.920
I'll go around and find her.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.280
Stop messing around.

13:07.240 --> 13:08.240
Fine.

13:09.240 --> 13:10.680
If I offend you,

13:11.240 --> 13:13.080
I'm afraid I'll have no one

13:13.600 --> 13:15.600
to drink and talk with
in this Fairy Realm.

13:16.480 --> 13:17.360
Listen.

13:18.600 --> 13:19.960
Just relax a little.

13:20.960 --> 13:22.040
You're so anxious.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.200
Even I feel tired for you.

13:25.960 --> 13:26.800
Let's drink.

14:10.960 --> 14:12.640
No! My body!

15:02.240 --> 15:03.400
I'm back.

15:50.480 --> 15:53.600
DONGFANG QINGCANG, THE MOON SUPREME

16:08.480 --> 16:09.880
Something happened at Haotian Tower.

16:17.800 --> 16:18.680
You…

16:19.160 --> 16:20.280
You…

16:21.600 --> 16:24.280
Weren't you quite arrogant just now?

16:28.080 --> 16:29.160
Not really.

16:30.520 --> 16:33.200
Thanks to you,

16:33.280 --> 16:34.640
I got to see these Nine Stars.

16:37.240 --> 16:39.360
I'll repay you.

16:40.400 --> 16:42.000
No need.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.920
My master taught me

16:44.000 --> 16:47.440
not to expect rewards while giving.

17:37.880 --> 17:38.800
What's happening?

17:40.360 --> 17:42.320
Why am I suffering like her?

18:27.200 --> 18:28.320
It hurts.

18:33.280 --> 18:34.200
Great.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.560
I've escaped.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.120
Lord Changheng.

18:44.880 --> 18:45.760
I did it.

18:45.840 --> 18:47.440
Lord Changheng is fine.

18:57.040 --> 18:58.680
The Haotian Matrix is completely intact.

19:01.280 --> 19:02.680
Then what was that noise?

19:05.480 --> 19:06.360
My lord.

19:06.920 --> 19:08.440
The prison at the bottom
of Haotian Tower is damaged.

19:08.520 --> 19:09.680
Some immortal criminals escaped.

19:17.160 --> 19:18.320
We're so lucky.

19:18.400 --> 19:21.560
I don't know what caused
the cell walls to shatter just now.

19:30.480 --> 19:31.560
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

19:37.080 --> 19:37.920
Who is it?

19:41.560 --> 19:42.480
Who is it?

20:19.840 --> 20:21.320
Take them back to Haotian Tower.

20:22.720 --> 20:23.600
Take them away.

20:23.680 --> 20:24.560
- Yes.
- Yes.

21:01.880 --> 21:04.720
ROOFTOP OF YUNZHONG WATER PAVILION,
SHUIYUNTIAN

21:13.560 --> 21:14.480
Lord Yunzhong,

21:14.560 --> 21:16.720
two immortal criminals
who escaped just now

21:16.800 --> 21:18.480
have been taken back to Haotian Tower.

21:18.560 --> 21:20.800
I've counted the rest
of the immortal criminals one by one

21:20.880 --> 21:23.360
and assigned the Yujing guards
to patrol around.

21:24.120 --> 21:25.320
How is the Haotian Matrix?

21:27.400 --> 21:28.360
It's completely intact.

21:30.960 --> 21:31.840
Go.

21:32.600 --> 21:33.440
Yes.

21:42.560 --> 21:43.520
The handkerchief.

22:13.080 --> 22:17.560
YUJING, SHUIYUNTIAN

22:17.640 --> 22:18.560
Have you heard of it?

22:18.640 --> 22:20.960
The immortal criminals of Haotian Tower
escaped last night.

22:21.040 --> 22:22.640
- Really?
- Yes.

22:22.720 --> 22:25.040
- Haotian Tower is a forbidden place.
- Who knows?

22:25.120 --> 22:27.920
The God of War, Changheng,
has captured those who escaped.

22:28.000 --> 22:28.920
No one was left out.

22:29.920 --> 22:30.880
Really?

22:30.960 --> 22:31.880
Of course.

22:32.400 --> 22:34.600
With Changheng in Yujing,
there's nothing to be afraid of.

22:35.200 --> 22:36.120
You're right.

22:37.120 --> 22:38.000
Goodness.

22:38.080 --> 22:39.280
What's with the act?

22:39.360 --> 22:41.080
With that lowly skill of yours,

22:41.160 --> 22:43.240
you can't win against Lord Changheng.

22:44.400 --> 22:46.400
See? You got caught, right?

22:47.720 --> 22:53.200
OBLIVION RIVER

23:22.800 --> 23:23.640
Shangque.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.720
SHANGQUE,
THE MOON SUPREME'S LIEUTENANT

24:11.800 --> 24:12.680
My lord,

24:13.240 --> 24:15.240
I've been waiting for you
for 30,000 years.

24:15.800 --> 24:17.200
Everyone said you were dead.

24:17.280 --> 24:18.200
Now,

24:18.760 --> 24:20.640
you've finally returned
to the three realms.

24:21.720 --> 24:22.600
Dead?

24:23.400 --> 24:25.200
I am immortal.

24:26.200 --> 24:27.640
Follow me to Xuanxu Realm.

24:46.640 --> 24:48.520
SOUL TRANSFORMATION GROUNDS,
HAISHI

24:48.600 --> 24:50.520
Throw them
into the Soul Transformation Cauldron

24:51.080 --> 24:52.520
and make evil qis.

24:53.080 --> 24:54.000
Yes.

25:10.040 --> 25:10.960
Pavilion Master,

25:11.040 --> 25:12.960
those who went to find
Goddess of Xishan are back.

25:13.040 --> 25:14.680
- Let's go back to Liufang Pavilion.
- Yes.

25:27.800 --> 25:32.800
LIUFANG PAVILION, HAISHI

25:32.880 --> 25:34.840
Pavilion Master, they are all here.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.800
How useless.

25:35.880 --> 25:37.400
DIEYI, PAVILION MASTER
OF LIUFANG PAVILION OF HAISHI

25:37.920 --> 25:39.280
After searching for so long,

25:39.360 --> 25:41.240
you only found some lowly plant spirits.

25:41.320 --> 25:42.600
- I'm incompetent.
- Forget it.

25:43.560 --> 25:45.520
The lord has planned this
for 10,000 years.

25:45.600 --> 25:46.760
There's no need to rush.

25:47.320 --> 25:48.160
Pavilion Master,

25:48.240 --> 25:49.120
for 10,000 years,

25:49.200 --> 25:50.840
we have searched
all over the three realms.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.880
Who is the lord looking for?

25:52.960 --> 25:54.440
Don't ask things that you shouldn't.

25:54.920 --> 25:55.760
Yes.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.480
Take them to Soul Transformation Grounds.

25:57.560 --> 25:58.480
Yes.

26:05.520 --> 26:06.480
HIDDEN TREASURE SHOP

26:09.080 --> 26:10.840
- Listen to me. I'm never wrong.
- Yes.

26:10.920 --> 26:12.080
- Are you satisfied?
- Yes.

26:12.600 --> 26:13.560
Please come again, sir.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.600
- Sure.
- Bye.

26:19.280 --> 26:20.280
What are you doing here?

26:20.360 --> 26:22.280
I have plenty of money today.

26:22.360 --> 26:23.640
I'm here to give you business.

26:25.440 --> 26:26.520
It can't be wrong.

26:27.160 --> 26:29.040
It's a new top-quality product in my shop.

26:29.520 --> 26:31.400
It's a rare medicine
from Southern Fairyland,

26:31.960 --> 26:33.560
the Universe Pill.

26:34.120 --> 26:36.200
It can surely cure
your immortal root this time.

26:37.880 --> 26:39.320
- But--
- I'll buy it.

26:46.960 --> 26:49.160
You need three Universe Pills
to see the effect

26:49.240 --> 26:50.320
and eight pills to cure it completely.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.840
Each bottle has exactly eight pills.

26:52.400 --> 26:54.800
It'll be 465 low-grade spirit stones.

26:54.880 --> 26:57.200
As for premium spirit stones,
it'll be 28.6.

26:57.760 --> 26:59.320
I'll give you a friend's price
as you're my old customer.

26:59.400 --> 27:00.800
I'll cancel the 0.6

27:00.880 --> 27:02.800
and make it 28 premium spirit stones.

27:03.640 --> 27:05.920
You still need seven more.

27:06.960 --> 27:07.840
Give them to me.

27:11.800 --> 27:12.760
That many?

27:12.840 --> 27:13.840
Too expensive?

27:15.760 --> 27:16.760
Jieli.

27:16.840 --> 27:17.800
Jieli.

27:18.560 --> 27:20.720
We are best friends, right?

27:20.800 --> 27:21.640
Yes.

27:22.640 --> 27:24.840
Since we are best friends

27:24.920 --> 27:26.440
and I'm also your regular customer,

27:26.520 --> 27:28.840
only canceling 0.6 seems too little.

27:28.920 --> 27:31.400
Is our friendship
only worth 0.6 spirit stones?

27:31.480 --> 27:33.120
I don't think it's appropriate.

27:33.720 --> 27:35.480
It's not appropriate.

27:36.480 --> 27:38.400
Our friendship is priceless.

27:40.520 --> 27:41.840
Then I won't cancel the 0.6.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.600
It'll be 28.6 spirit stones.

27:43.680 --> 27:45.320
Nothing less.

27:49.320 --> 27:50.240
Get up.

27:50.800 --> 27:52.200
Get up.

27:52.280 --> 27:53.200
Get up.

27:53.280 --> 27:54.920
You're disturbing my account checking.

27:55.000 --> 27:56.120
I don't care.

27:56.880 --> 27:59.360
I must buy this medicine today.

27:59.440 --> 28:01.240
This is too important to me.

28:01.320 --> 28:03.960
I won't leave if you don't give it to me.

28:05.720 --> 28:06.680
Whatever.

28:09.240 --> 28:10.960
Miss, these clothes…

28:11.560 --> 28:13.040
Why are these still here?

28:13.120 --> 28:15.440
Shouldn't these be sent
to Liufang Pavilion a few days ago?

28:15.520 --> 28:17.720
I've been too busy these days. I forgot.

28:17.800 --> 28:19.240
Hurry and send them over.

28:19.320 --> 28:20.880
I dare not.

28:20.960 --> 28:23.880
Miss, those people
at Liufang Pavilion are the cruelest.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.320
If I send them over now,

28:25.400 --> 28:26.440
I'll get scolded.

28:26.520 --> 28:28.680
They might even beat me up.

28:29.280 --> 28:30.680
Miss, look.

28:30.760 --> 28:32.120
If they hurt me,

28:32.200 --> 28:33.680
who will work for you?

28:33.760 --> 28:34.760
Right?

28:40.880 --> 28:42.280
Give them to me. Get back to work.

28:42.760 --> 28:43.600
Yes.

28:45.520 --> 28:46.400
Hey.

28:47.040 --> 28:49.600
Since we are friends,
I'll help you this time.

28:51.640 --> 28:52.720
Run an errand for me.

28:53.560 --> 28:55.560
Send these clothes to Liufang Pavilion.

28:56.160 --> 28:58.480
Then I'll extend your payment period

28:59.040 --> 29:00.000
for the Universe Pills.

29:01.200 --> 29:02.520
That's a deal.

29:03.040 --> 29:04.600
But the credit interest is 50%.

29:04.680 --> 29:05.720
I said 50%.

29:05.800 --> 29:06.760
Okay.

29:10.880 --> 29:12.680
The lord's plan is based on this.

29:12.760 --> 29:14.280
Nothing can go wrong.

29:14.760 --> 29:16.800
If anything happens,
report to me immediately.

29:16.880 --> 29:17.760
Yes.

29:18.360 --> 29:19.680
Phoenix Plant Spirit has escaped.

29:19.760 --> 29:20.680
Hurry. Go there.

29:20.760 --> 29:21.880
You, here.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.800
Search.

29:22.880 --> 29:24.200
- Yes.
- Yes.

29:50.880 --> 29:52.240
Put down the clothes and go.

30:01.000 --> 30:02.440
Don't kill me.

30:06.520 --> 30:07.600
It's so chaotic outside.

30:07.680 --> 30:08.680
Are they looking for you?

30:10.800 --> 30:12.120
Why do they want to kill you?

30:12.680 --> 30:13.640
I don't know.

30:16.400 --> 30:17.800
Please save me.

30:17.880 --> 30:18.920
I don't want to die yet.

30:22.400 --> 30:23.720
I'll find a way to get you out.

30:39.520 --> 30:40.360
Look over there.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.600
There's nothing here.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.400
Keep looking.

31:08.120 --> 31:09.200
There's a Destiny Book here.

31:09.800 --> 31:10.640
No way.

31:36.600 --> 31:37.800
It's really a Destiny Book.

31:38.400 --> 31:40.320
Shouldn't it be at the Arbiter Hall?

31:40.400 --> 31:41.280
Why is it…

32:22.800 --> 32:24.320
Nameless Destiny Book?

32:25.760 --> 32:27.080
What's going on?

32:28.280 --> 32:31.640
AN ANCIENT BATTLEFIELD, XUANXU REALM

32:31.720 --> 32:32.760
My lord,

32:32.840 --> 32:34.760
during the Battle of Two Tribes
30,000 years ago,

32:34.840 --> 32:36.480
100,000 soldiers were trapped here.

32:37.240 --> 32:40.480
We can only counterattack Shuiyuntian
if we break their seal.

33:18.640 --> 33:22.400
THIRTY THOUSAND YEARS AGO

33:25.200 --> 33:27.440
LADY CHIDI, GOD OF WAR

33:27.520 --> 33:30.400
I have the Soul of Vajra. I am immortal.

33:30.480 --> 33:31.960
The supreme lord of the three realms.

33:32.040 --> 33:35.640
You're just a woman
and you want to kill me?

33:35.720 --> 33:36.760
Moon Supreme.

33:37.680 --> 33:40.640
Underestimating the enemy
is a military taboo.

33:41.160 --> 33:42.920
The weak have taboos.

33:43.000 --> 33:44.720
I have no taboos.

33:45.280 --> 33:46.600
You will lose.

35:15.720 --> 35:16.760
Nothing here.

35:16.840 --> 35:17.720
Nothing here either.

35:17.800 --> 35:18.840
- Keep looking.
- Yes.

35:18.920 --> 35:19.920
Yes.

35:46.040 --> 35:46.960
After the battle,

35:47.920 --> 35:49.880
the news of your death
spread to Cangyan Sea.

35:50.400 --> 35:52.400
Lord Xunfeng was appointed
as the new Moon Supreme.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.760
However, within just a hundred years,

35:54.840 --> 35:56.920
the kings of southern and northern
rebelled one after another

35:57.000 --> 35:58.120
and made themselves kings.

35:59.280 --> 36:00.480
In these 30,000 years,

36:01.160 --> 36:02.640
Cangyan Sea has constant civil unrest.

36:04.360 --> 36:05.320
Xunfeng.

36:07.080 --> 36:09.640
My younger brother is still as stupid
and incompetent as ever.

36:14.920 --> 36:16.240
How about the Fairy Tribe?

36:16.320 --> 36:17.360
My lord.

36:17.960 --> 36:19.160
In these 30,000 years,

36:19.240 --> 36:20.720
the Fairy Realm has taken over lands

36:20.800 --> 36:22.480
as the chaos took place in Cangyan Sea.

36:22.560 --> 36:24.640
Recently, they even invaded
the Northernmost Ocean.

36:24.720 --> 36:26.360
Now they are getting
stronger and stronger.

36:29.040 --> 36:31.160
The hypocrites of Shuiyuntian

36:31.960 --> 36:35.120
can only trap me using these dirty tricks.

36:35.760 --> 36:38.320
They bullied the Moon Tribe
while we had no leader.

36:39.480 --> 36:41.640
We have 100,000 elite soldiers
in Cangyan Sea.

36:41.720 --> 36:43.800
How can we bear insults like this?

36:44.560 --> 36:46.880
Today, I've returned to the three realms.

36:47.560 --> 36:49.640
I'll lead my former men

36:50.240 --> 36:51.720
to revive Cangyan Sea

36:52.440 --> 36:54.200
and wipe out Shuiyuntian.

37:38.320 --> 37:40.120
My lord, how could this happen?

37:40.720 --> 37:43.240
Shuofeng Sword is the root of the seal.

37:43.760 --> 37:45.120
The sacred weapon knows its master.

37:45.920 --> 37:48.560
Only Lady Chidi can loosen it.

37:51.080 --> 37:52.520
But 30,000 years ago,

37:53.480 --> 37:56.720
her primordial spirit
was shattered and burned.

37:58.120 --> 37:59.040
Who are you?

37:59.520 --> 38:01.360
How dare you make a scene in Haishi?

38:01.440 --> 38:02.720
I'm a fairy of Shuiyuntian.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.680
What do you want?

38:26.320 --> 38:27.520
My lord.

38:39.160 --> 38:41.080
Could she be the one behind this?

38:41.880 --> 38:45.760
SOUL TRANSFORMATION GROUNDS,
HAISHI

38:48.520 --> 38:49.360
Let's go.

39:11.680 --> 39:13.600
Help!
